@startuml
title State machine model of a weather station system

[*] --> ShutDown : [system restart]

state ShutDown
ShutDown : do / display welcome message

state ConfigMode
ConfigMode : entry / user requests configuration mode
ConfigMode : do / allow changes or power-saving settings
ConfigMode : exit / complete configuration, return to running state

state Running
Running : entry / system is up and running
Running : do / collect data when triggered by clock
Running : do / prepare and send weather summary upon request
Running : do / check status and transmit result upon request
Running : exit / perform activity (data collection, summary preparation, or status checking)

state ControlledMode
ControlledMode : entry / user requests remote control
ControlledMode : do / allow controlled mode operations

state ShutDownCondition
ShutDownCondition : entry / shutdown command given while running
ShutDownCondition : do / shut down system

[*] --> Running : [system is up and running]
Running --> ConfigMode : [user requests configuration mode]
ConfigMode --> Running : [configuration completed]
Running --> ControlledMode : [user requests remote control]
ControlledMode --> Running : [remote control ended]
Running --> ShutDownCondition : [shutdown command given while running]
ShutDownCondition --> ShutDown : [system shut down]

@enduml
